<!--
  Themed adaptive-icon monochrome — faithful monochrome silhouette of the full-colour
  foreground (ic_muslim_launcher_foreground_v2028.png).

  Design DNA (Modern Islamic Minimalism):
  • Hollow 8-point star = interlaced outer frame (two squares, 0° + 45°) rendered as a
    hollow outline (outer star + inner star evenOdd) so the fill matches the PNG's
    thick gold hollow frames rather than a solid star blob.
  • Frame thickness ~ 6–8 dp at 108 viewport → crisp at 24 dp status size and at
    108 dp themed-icon size; respects 34% safe margin, no clipping on circle/square masks.
  • Central mihrab = hollow arch outline (outer arch + inner arch) for the same gold
    frame language; sits cleanly inside the star's interior hole.
  • Crescent = difference of two circles (R13.5 / R11) perched on the mihrab apex,
    identical silhouette to the foreground's apex crescent.

  Why hollow vs solid: the foreground PNG shows thick interlaced frames with dark
  interior; a solid monochrome star would diverge visually and read as a different
  identity in the shade/lock-screen vs launcher. The hollow treatment keeps launcher,
  themed icon, notification small icon and Wear glyph visually unified while remaining
  a single-colour, tint-system-compliant silhouette.
-->
